        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First impressions DRB1006BRPSG, Victorian Style Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNormally used or hallway or closet doors, the Victorian Sliding Pocket Door Passage Set includes 1 flush pull that wraps around both sides of the door with an attached edge pull. The edge pull flips out so you can pull a sliding door out of a pocket. It is available to fit 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors. The Darby  Flush Pull is available in an array of high-quality finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/victorian-sliding-pocket-door-privacy-lock-first-impressions-drb1006brpvc\"><b>Victorian Privacy Lock Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/victorian-pocket-door-flush-pull-pair-first-impressions-drb1006138br\"><b>Victorian Flush Pull Set</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions DRB1006BRPSG Victorian Pocket Door Passage Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Max Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Max Depth: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DRB02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262215\"><b>First Impressions DRB1006BRPSG Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged as a set that includes 2 flush pulls, flip out edge pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Sliding Pocket Door Passage Set",
                "description": "This Victorian Sliding Pocket Door Passage Set is of the finest quality, offering both fashion and function. It is great for closet and hallway doors. The Darby 2 Flush Pull is available at Doorware.com today!",
